        },
        {
          "text": "Akananiti, nu horiini iyyaana, qeench'i isaani tokoleeni asi inhafu. Wonti akanatiifi numati hori keenna keesa waan sorio Waaqa baamnu foha. Ammalle haga achiini baanuti hori sorio AABBO Waaqa baasu malani nu imbeennu.",
          "type": "text",
